# The story patterns' previews (src/story.ts): a conversation, a visual novel, quests.
string "dlg.mira" "米拉"
string "dlg.aria" "艾莉亚"
string "dlg.gate.open" "大门在黎明时分开启。你准备好穿过去了吗？"
string "dlg.gate.ready" "我准备好了，走吧。"
string "dlg.gate.persuade" "先告诉我门后有什么。"
string "dlg.gate.read" "你以前见过这种神情。"
string "dlg.gate.who" "还有谁知道这扇门？"
string "dlg.gate.toll" "付给守门人通行费。"
string "dlg.gate.need" "还差 {need} 信用点"
string "dlg.gate.notyet" "还不行。"
string "dlg.who" "只有档案官知道，她已经沉默了九年。"
string "dlg.secret" "门后是古老的天文台。星图上看到的东西，至今还在那里。"
string "dlg.refuse" "要么你亲眼去看，要么永远别看。"
string "dlg.ready" "那我们趁潮水转向前出发。"
string "dlg.stat.charm" "说服"
string "dlg.stat.insight" "洞察"
string "dlg.skip" "跳过"
